a2:FOODON_03470106 owl:sameAs a2:FOODON_03470106 ;
    rdfs:subClassOf a2:FOODON_03470145 , a2:FOODON_03460141 ;
    rdfs:label "food smoking process" ;
    rdfs:comment "LanguaL curation note: Used when smoking is used for preservation." , "In the past, smoking was a useful preservation tool, in combination with other techniques, most commonly salt-curing or drying. For some long-smoked foods, the smoking time also served to dry the food. Drying, curing, or other techniques can render the interior of foods inhospitable to bacterial life, while the smoking gives the vulnerable exterior surfaces an extra layer of protection. [Wikipedia]" ;
    rdf:type owl:Class .

"http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=H0118" owl:sameAs "http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=H0118" .

