a2:FOODON_03430122 owl:sameAs a2:FOODON_03430122 ;
    rdfs:subClassOf a2:FOODON_03430113 ;
    rdfs:label "divided or disintegrated" ;
    rdfs:comment "LanguaL curation note: The distinctions in this category are based on size characteristics, primarily thickness, which are important for heat transfer and for diffusion of chemicals in processing. *DIVIDED INTO HALVES, QUARTERS OR SEGMENTS* should be examined first and if one of the descriptors listed applies it should be used regardless of the size of the pieces. If none of these are applicable, other *DIVIDED OR DISINTEGRATED* descriptors should be examined. Do not use any of these descriptors if dividing or disintegrating results in a semiliquid or semisolid product." ;
    rdf:type owl:Class .

